      "writtenOn": "2025-03-21T23:45:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IMPORTANT: If obu_header.has_extension is false, the OBU may still be layer-specific. That can happen when there is only one layer.\n\nThis reminded me of a fact I discovered while analyzing this code: `metadata-\u003einsert_flag` is only used by the encoder and is ignored by the decoder. So in this file (used by the decoder only) we should simply set `metadata-\u003einsert_flag` to an arbitrary fixed value, such as `AOM_MIF_ANY_FRAME`. We can even add a new enum constant `AOM_MIF_UNUSED` or `AOM_MIF_IGNORED` for use in the decoder.",
      "revId": "9182de0a11cf28074759cc6bf6c34971916d56ab",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
    },
